<title>USA: VHS says all but 1 officer, director quit.</title>
<headline>VHS says all but 1 officer, director quit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>VHS Network Inc said all but one of its officers and directors resigned, effective April 3.</p>
<p>The one remaining director was Thomas Roberts, the company said.</p>
<p>The company also said Elwin Cathcart will be its new chief executive and David Smelsky its new chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Officials from the company, which is based in Florida, were not immediately available to comment further.</p>
<p>The company included the news in a press release regarding the closing of its agreement to buy VHS Network Canada Inc from GroupMark Canada Ltd.</p>
